'''boomerang''' (formerly known as '''DragonClaw''', '''Oramond''', and '''VRSDelivery''') is an organization-less [[:Category:Poland|Polish]] ''[[Counter-Strike 2]]'' team which was formed after [[Reason Gaming]] parted ways with their roster.

==Timeline==
{{tabs dynamic
|name1=2025
|name2=2026
