|content2=
* May 11th - '''Oramond''' rename to '''VRSDelivery'''. <ref name="vrsdelivery">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/Vrsdelivery/status/2053830806196347278|title=Wracamy do rywalizacji jako VRS Delivery|trans_title=We are back in the competition as VRS Delivery|language={{Flag|pl}} Polish|date=2026-05-11|author='''VRSDelivery'''}}</ref>
* May 17th - '''VRSDelivery''' part ways with [[Frontsiderr]] and [[SpavaQ]] and add [[Brylu]] and [[PeTeRoOo]]. <ref name="change duo">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/Vrsdelivery/status/2056082354863526089|title=Przyszła chwila aby wam zdradzić jakim składem rozpoczniemy zmagania w Turniejach|trans_title=The time has come to reveal to you what lineup we will start the tournaments with|language={{Flag|pl}} Polish|date=2026-05-17|author='''VRSDelivery'''}}</ref>
* May 30th - '''VRSDelivery''' rename to '''DragonClaw'''. <ref name="dragonclaw">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/Vrsdelivery/status/2060716927505289728|title=Przyszedł czas na zmianę nazwy Drużyny|trans_title=It's time to change the name of the Team|language={{Flag|pl}} Polish|date=2026-05-30|author='''DragonClaw'''}}</ref>
* June 2nd - [[AntyVirus]] steps down from '''DragonClaw''' and retires from competitive ''[[Counter-Strike 2]]''. <ref name="antyvirus retires">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/44764/antyvirus-retires-amidst-matchfixing-and-cheating-allegations|title=AntyVirus retires amidst matchfixing and cheating allegations|publisher=[[HLTV]]|date=2026-06-02|author=[[Nohte]]}}</ref>
